    "description": "<p>Timelapse photos record (with 3289 photos) from a construction site in Portugal (in Montijo) from company Garcia, Garcia S.A., with meteorological data from Coopernicus database in excel.</p>\n<p>Photos are taken from working hours, with a 15 minutes time difference from 2025-04 to 2025-03. Photo name follows nomenclature \"YYYY-MM-DD_HH-MM\".</p>\n<p>Several meteorological conditions can be observed (e.g. sun, clouds, rain, fog, etc.) alongside with evolving construction site alterations (e.g. earth, sub-base, bitominous).&nbsp;</p>",
